<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Rugby Union - Leinster-Australia match cancelled.</title>
<headline>Rugby Union - Leinster-Australia match cancelled.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tuesday night's rugby union match between Leinster and Australia at Lansdowne Road has been cancelled because of the bad weather and will not be rescheduled, Ireland's rugby authorities said.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 660 3377</p>
</text>
